cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "StreamCheck: Static Detection of Exactly-Once Violations in Payment Stream Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  A checker that gathers facts from a stream processor's configuration, its
  client properties, its job definition, an operational runbook and a
  declaration of a payment provider's idempotency contract, derives the replay
  horizon from them, and reports the structural and duration defects that break
  exactly-once. Each finding is turned into an executable scenario whose
  observable is money moving twice, validated against a real Kafka broker.
type: software
